#question(title: [Example 1: a constant function])[
  #set text(size: 13pt)

  Consider the function #h(.25em) $f(x) = 2$
  #h(.25em) on #h(.25em) $[0, 4]$.
  #v(0.2cm)

  + Given
    $display(P = {0 comma 1 comma e comma pi comma 4})$,
    compute $display(L_P (f))$ and
    $display(U_P (f))$.
  + Explicitly compute #emph[all] the upper
    sums and #emph[all] the lower sums.
     #v(0.2cm)
  + Compute $display(overline(I_0^4) (f))$
  + Compute $display(underline(I_0^4) (f))$
  + Is $f$ integrable on $[0, 4]$?
]
